---
import Shot from './Shot.astro';
import { site } from '@/config/site';
---

<section id="ways" class="wrap ways">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2 class="h2" style="max-width:18ch">
      One engine. Drive it from the app, the terminal or an assistant.
    </h2>
    <p class="lede">
      A background engine runs the radio, and decoders and watches keep going after the window
      closes. The Mac app, the <span class="mono ley">ley</span> command and MCP clients all talk to
      it, so a squelch change in the terminal shows up in the window, and an assistant can sweep a
      band and tell you what’s on it.
    </p>
  </div>

  <Shot name="ways-sync" />

  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head">
        <span class="label mono">The app</span>
        <span class="desc">Waterfall, bands, inspector and Library. For listening.</span>
      </div>
      <Shot name="ways-app" class="card-shot" />
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head">
        <span class="label mono">The terminal</span>
        <span class="desc">
          <span class="mono code">ley</span> for scripts, cron jobs and SSH. Every command that
          reports something has <span class="mono code">--json</span>.
        </span>
      </div>
      <pre class="term shell"><span class="cmd">$ ley tune 146.52</span>
using NFM: 2 m amateur band default
Listening to 146.520 MHz (NFM, 2 m amateur)
<span class="hi">146.520 MHz NFM  signal -12 dBFS  <span class="teal">on air 2 s</span></span>
<span class="cmd">$ ley set squelch -45</span>
squelch -53 dBFS → -45 dBFS on 146.520 MHz NFM (channel 1)</pre>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-head">
        <span class="label mono">An assistant</span>
        <span class="desc">
          <span class="mono code">ley mcp</span> lets an AI assistant tune, scan, decode and record,
          over MCP.
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="chat">
        <div class="bubble me">Scan 2 m and tell me what’s active.</div>
        <div class="tool mono">scan 144M..148M</div>
        <div class="bubble them">
          Five carriers. 146.520 (calling), 146.940, 147.180 and 145.230 were up for the whole
          sweep; 144.390 (APRS) showed once.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <a
    href={site.links.docs}
    class="mono docs"
    data-track="documentation_opened"
    data-placement="ways_section"
  >
    Read the docs for ley and MCP →
  </a>
</section>

<style>
  .ways {
    padding-top: 160px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 44px;
  }

  .ley {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 250px), 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-3);
    border-radius: 11px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .card-head {
    padding: 20px 22px 16px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .label {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .desc {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-2);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .code {
    font-size: 13px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .card :global(.card-shot) {
    margin: 0 22px 22px;
    width: auto;
    border-color: var(--line-2);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .shell {
    flex: 1;
    margin: 0 22px 22px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--bg-deep);
    padding: 14px;
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .chat {
    flex: 1;
    margin: 0 22px 22px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 9px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-family: var(--font-mac);
  }

  .bubble {
    padding: 9px 12px;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .me {
    align-self: flex-end;
    max-width: 86%;
    border-radius: 12px 12px 3px;
    background: var(--surface-sel);
    color: var(--text-bright);
  }

  .them {
    align-self: flex-start;
    max-width: 92%;
    border-radius: 12px 12px 12px 3px;
    background: var(--surface-3);
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .tool {
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 5px 9px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--teal-deep);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--teal);
  }

  .docs {
    align-self: flex-start;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
</style>
